> integrate sin(x: real)
∫ sin(x) dx
  = -cos(x) + C
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 0)
> integrate cos(x: real)
∫ cos(x) dx
  = sin(x) + C
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 0)
> integrate tan(x: real)
∫ tan(x) dx
  = -log(abs(cos(x))) + C
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 2.8e-14)
> integrate exp(x: real)
∫ exp(x) dx
  = exp(x) + C
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 0)
> integrate log(x: real)
∫ log(x) dx
  = x*log(x) - x + C
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 200 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 2.2e-16)
> integrate sqrt(x: real)
∫ sqrt(x) dx
  = 2sqrt(x)^3/3 + C
  method: substitution t = sqrt(x)
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 200 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 4.4e-16)
> integrate atan(x: real)
∫ atan(x) dx
  = x*atan(x) - log(x^2 + 1)/2 + C
  method: by parts (u = atan(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 2.2e-16)
> integrate asin(x: real)
∫ asin(x) dx
  = x*asin(x) + sqrt(1 - x^2) + C
  method: by parts (u = asin(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 39 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 2.2e-16)
> integrate acosh(x: real)
∫ acosh(x) dx
  = x*acosh(x) - sqrt(x^2 - 1) + C
  method: by parts (u = acosh(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 180 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 4.4e-16)
> integrate atanh(x: real)
∫ atanh(x) dx
  = x*atanh(x) + log(abs(x + 1))/2 + log(abs(x - 1))/2 + C
  method: by parts (u = atanh(x))
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 39 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.1e-15)
> integrate sec(x: real)
∫ sec(x) dx
  = log(abs(sin(x) + 1))/2 - log(abs(sin(x) - 1))/2 + C
  method: Bioche: t = sin(x)
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.6e-09)
> integrate csc(x: real)
∫ csc(x) dx
  = log(abs(cos(x) - 1))/2 - log(abs(cos(x) + 1))/2 + C
  method: Bioche: t = cos(x)
  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 400 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 4.4e-11)
